{"sha": "fcfbf4db5d24e01cc55f76182911ab460ffe1eb37bf2d4dfe3bfc327ea779917", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:photochemistry} 章 --- 光化学}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:1}", "$E = hc/\\lambda = \\qty{5.442e-19}{J}$；$0.100/\\num{5.442e-19} = \\num{1.84e17}$ 每秒光子数，即", "\\qty{3.05e-7}{einstein.s^{-1}}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:2}", "吸收的光量：$\\num{1.00e-7} \\times 600 = \\qty{6.00e-5}{einstein}$；$\\Phi = \\num{2.0e-5}/\\num{6.0e-5} = 0.33$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:3}", "参与反应的分子数远多于被吸收的光子数：每个被光解的 \\ce{Cl2} 都会引发一条", "链，即 $\\ce{Cl + H2 -> HCl + H}$ 与 $\\ce{H + Cl2 -> HCl + Cl}$，此链在终止前可循环数千次，", "直至链终止。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:4}", "$D_0(\\ce{O2}) = 2 \\times 246.79 = \\qty{493.58}{kJ/mol}$; $\\lambda = hcN_A/D_0 = 0.119627/493\\,580 =", "\\qty{242.4}{nm}$. $\\ce{O3 -> O2 + O}$: $246.79 - 145.35 = \\qty{101.44}{kJ/mol}$, $\\lambda = \\qty{1179}{nm}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:5}", "$[Z]/[E] = 22\\,000 \\times 0.11/(1500 \\times 0.40) = 4.0$: 80\\,\\% $Z$, 20\\,\\% $E$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:6}", "2-己酮：1,4-双自由基裂解为丙酮的烯醇（由此生成丙酮）和", "丙烯，或闭环生成 1,2-二甲基环丁-1-醇。在 2-戊酮中，$\\gamma$", "碳为末端的 \\ce{CH3}：断裂 $\\alpha$--$\\beta$ 键，留下 $\\ce{CH2=CH2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:7}", "$K = \\exp[(E_{\\mathrm T}(\\mathrm D) - 250)/RT]$，其中 $RT = \\qty{2.478}{kJ/mol}$：289 时 $\\eu^{15.7} = \\num{7e6}$；", "253 时 $\\eu^{1.2} = 3.4$；236 时 $\\eu^{-5.6} = \\num{3.5e-3}$。仅第一种几乎在", "每次碰撞时都发生转移。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:8}", "$k_2 = \\num{6.0e-34} \\times (230/300)^{-2.6} = \\qty{1.20e-33}{cm^6.s^{-1}}$; $k_2[\\mathrm M][\\ce{O2}] = \\num{1.20e-33} \\times", "\\num{4.0e17} \\times \\num{8.4e16} = \\qty{40}{s^{-1}}$; $[\\ce{O}]/[\\ce{O3}] = \\num{1.0e-3}/40 = \\num{2.5e-5}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:9}", "$k(\\ce{Cl + O3}) = \\num{2.8e-11}\\eu^{-250/230} = \\num{9.4e-12}$; $k(\\ce{Cl + CH4}) = \\num{6.6e-12}\\eu^{-1240/230} = \\num{3.0e-14}$", "\\unit{cm^3.s^{-1}}。伪一级速率分别为 54 与 \\qty{0.012}{s^{-1}}：概率为 $54/54.01 = 0.9998$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:10}", "$k = \\num{2.07e-12}\\eu^{-1400/298.15} = \\qty{1.89e-14}{cm^3.s^{-1}}$; $[\\ce{O3}] = \\num{8.0e-3} \\times 1.5/\\num{1.89e-14} =", "\\qty{6.3e11}{cm^{-3}}$。空气在 \\qty{1}{bar} 和 \\qty{298}{K} 下，$p/k_BT = \\qty{2.43e19}{cm^{-3}}$，即相当于 \\qty{26}{ppb}。夜间", "\\ce{NO2} 不再被光解，NO 会破坏臭氧，直至二者之一耗尽。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:11}", "$E = hc/\\lambda = \\qty{6.347e-19}{J}$；$0.050/\\num{6.347e-19} = \\num{7.88e16}$ 每秒光子数 $= \\qty{1.31e-7}{einstein.s^{-1}}$。", "吸收量：$\\times(1 - 10^{-0.5}) = \\times0.684$，\\qty{8.95e-8}{einstein.s^{-1}}；速率 $0.25 \\times \\num{8.95e-8} =", "\\qty{2.24e-8}{mol.s^{-1}}$，即 \\qty{7.5e-6}{mol.L^{-1}.s^{-1}}，在 \\qty{3.0}{mL} 中。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:photochemistry:12}", "$I_0 = \\num{3.0e-6}/(1.25 \\times 60) = \\qty{4.0e-8}{einstein.s^{-1}}$。转化率较低时，化学光量计", "仍吸收全部光线，且有色产物并不起滤光作用。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b3:photochemistry:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $2 \\times 246.79 = \\qty{493.58}{kJ/mol}$.", "\\textbf{2.} $\\lambda = 0.119627/493\\,580 = \\qty{242.4}{nm}$.", "\\textbf{3.} $246.79 - 145.35 = \\qty{101.44}{kJ/mol}$; \\qty{1179}{nm}.", "\\textbf{4.} 臭氧的可见光吸收很弱；其强烈的紫外吸收", "（约 200 至 \\qty{310}{nm}）可去除会损伤 DNA 与皮肤的辐射。", "\\textbf{5.} 低于 \\qty{242}{nm} 的光在下行途中即被 \\ce{O2} 本身吸收，", "只有极少量能穿透到平流层上部以下。", "\\textbf{6.} $\\ce{O2 ->[h\\nu] 2 O}$; $\\mathrm{O + O_2 + M \\to O_3 + M}$; $\\ce{O3 ->[h\\nu] O2 + O}$; $\\ce{O + O3 -> 2 O2}$.", "\\textbf{7.} $k_2 = \\qty{1.20e-33}{cm^6.s^{-1}}$; $k_2[\\mathrm M] = \\qty{4.79e-16}{cm^3.s^{-1}}$.", "\\textbf{8.} $k_4 = \\num{8.0e-12}\\eu^{-2060/230} = \\qty{1.03e-15}{cm^3.s^{-1}}$.", "\\textbf{9.} $\\num{1.0e-3}/(\\num{4.79e-16} \\times \\num{8.4e16}) = \\num{2.49e-5}$.", "\\textbf{10.} 奇氧平衡 $2j_1[\\ce{O2}] = 2k_4[\\ce{O}][\\ce{O3}]$，其中 $[\\ce{O}] = j_3[\\ce{O3}]/(k_2[\\mathrm M][\\ce{O2}])$（见", "定理）。", "\\textbf{11.} $[\\ce{O3}] = \\num{8.4e16}\\sqrt{\\num{1.0e-11} \\times \\num{4.79e-16}/(\\num{1.0e-3} \\times \\num{1.03e-15})} =", "\\qty{5.7e12}{cm^{-3}}$，混合比为 $\\num{1.4e-5}$（\\qty{14}{ppm}）。", "\\textbf{12.} $\\num{2.49e-5} \\times \\num{5.7e12} = \\qty{1.4e8}{cm^{-3}}$.", "\\textbf{13.} 催化循环（氮氧化物、氢氧化物、氯）", "为奇氧增加了损耗途径。", "\\textbf{14.} $\\ce{Cl + O3 -> ClO + O2}$, $\\ce{ClO + O -> Cl + O2}$; net $\\ce{O + O3 -> 2 O2}$.", "\\textbf{15.} $1/(\\num{9.44e-12} \\times \\num{5.72e12}) = \\qty{0.019}{s}$.", "\\textbf{16.} $1/(\\num{4.033e-11} \\times \\num{1.423e8}) = \\qty{174}{s}$.", "\\textbf{17.} $174/0.0185 = \\num{9.4e3}$.", "\\textbf{18.} 几乎全部氯都以 ClO 形式存在：损耗为 $2 \\times \\num{5.74e-3} \\times \\num{1.0e7} = \\qty{1.1e5}{cm^{-3}.s^{-1}}$，", "与查普曼步骤的 $2k_4[\\ce{O}][\\ce{O3}] = \\qty{1.7e6}{cm^{-3}.s^{-1}}$ 相比，该循环增加了", "约 7\\,\\%。", "\\textbf{19.} $\\ce{ClO + O}$，为慢步骤（\\qty{174}{s}）。", "\\textbf{20.} $53.8/(53.8 + 0.012) = 0.99978$.", "\\textbf{21.} $\\num{5.74e-3}/(\\num{5.74e-3} + \\num{1.41e-13} \\times \\num{1.0e9}) = 0.976$.", "\\textbf{22.} $p = 0.976$.", "\\textbf{23.} $0.976/0.024 = 40$.", "\\textbf{24.} 在云粒子上，$\\ce{HCl + ClONO2 -> Cl2 + HNO3}$ 释放出氯，而硝酸", "留在粒子中：若无 \\ce{NO2}，$p_2$ 趋近于 1，链", "变得很长；经由 ClO 二聚体的循环无需 O 原子即可破坏臭氧。", "\\textbf{25.} \\textbf{每个氯原子在被捕获前约破坏 40 个臭氧分子}（在此", "\\qty{30}{km} 高度的模型中）；每个原子都会从其储库中多次释放出来。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}